          <h1>History of the <span>Banjara Community</span> — Origins, Culture &amp; Heritage</h1>
          <p>The complete story of India's largest nomadic trading community — the Banjara people (also known as Lambadi, Gormati, Lambani, and Sugali). From ancient Rajput origins to today's 3 crore strong community spread across India.</p>
